<title>ITALY: Naples airport total April cargo traffic up 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Naples airport total April cargo traffic up 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total cargo handled at Naples airport rose 4.0 percent in April compared to the same month last year boosted by a 6.0 percent in trucked cargo which outweighed a decline in flown cargo, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>		    April 97  Pct change    Jan-Apr 97  Pct Change</p>
<p>		   (tonnes)   from Apr 96  (tonnes)     from Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p>Cargo Imports</p>
<p>Flown	     142.7     down   9.9	455.4     down  14.3</p>
<p>Trucked	   191.9	 up   3.1	704 8     down   9.6</p>
<p>Total	     334.7     down   2.9    1,106.1     down  11.5</p>
<p>Cargo Exports</p>
<p>Flown	    181.3	 up   15.7	654.9     down   6.2</p>
<p>Trucked	    5.5	none in 96	  5.5     none in 96</p>
<p>Total	    186.8	 up   19.2	660.4     down   5.4</p>
<p>All Cargo</p>
<p>Flown	    324.1     down   2.8     1,110.2     down   5.7</p>
<p>Trucked	  197.5	 up   6.0	 710.3     down   8.8</p>
<p>Total	    521.6	 up   4.0     1,820.5     down   8.4</p>
<p>Total Mail     127.4     down   1.6	 652.4	 up  33.4</p>
<p>Total Pax   12,886.0     down   9.7    45,925.0	 up  21.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
